WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.458
This path follows your own allowance the coins in

00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:06.510
your pocket the jars at home and the piggy

00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:10.013
bank on the shelf A parent reads along with

00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:10.237
you

00:00:18.209 --> 00:00:22.119
Your allowance comes in the morning By afternoon it

00:00:22.145 --> 00:00:25.567
is gone You cannot remember where it went

00:00:33.539 --> 00:00:36.170
Every peso of allowance has a job before it

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.131
leaves your hand
